stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> seen: before photo detection
  seen --> claimed: user says done (text or voice)
  seen --> still_here: after photo, IoU >= 0.3 with before box
  claimed --> verified: after photo, box inside destination zone
  claimed --> not_visible: after photo, not detected
  claimed --> wrong_spot: after photo, outside destination
  seen --> verified: after photo, inside destination
  seen --> not_visible: after photo, not detected
  still_here --> claimed: user says done again
  wrong_spot --> claimed: user moves it
  not_visible --> verified: later photo shows it in zone
  not_visible --> verified_video: stretch, video clip evidence
  verified --> [*]
  verified_video --> [*]
